# Environment Variables
#
# This file documents the environment variables required by the project.
#
# Rules:
# - Never store real credentials or secrets in this file.
# - Copy this file to `.env` when starting local development.
# - Add only variables that are actually required by the project.
# - Document the purpose of non-obvious variables.
#
# Example:
#
# APP_ENV=development
# APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
# DATABASE_URL=
# API_KEY=
#
# Do not add real values for passwords, tokens, API keys,
# private keys, or production credentials.